    <section class="sa-section sa-intro" id="s-questions"><div class="sa-shell"><div class="sa-intro-grid"><div><div class="sa-kicker">FROM FRAGMENTED INFORMATION TO COMPLETE CLARITY</div><h2>Regulation moves faster when everything connects.</h2></div><div class="sa-intro-aside">See beyond submitted reports. Bring obligations, evidence, assessments and supervisory action into a shared system of record, giving every decision the context it deserves.<div class="sa-arrowline">Built for the way regulators actually work</div></div></div><div class="sa-question-grid"><div class="sa-qtile"><span class="sa-qicon">01</span><h3>Who is compliant?</h3><p>Understand assessed compliance across every organisation and applicable requirement.</p></div><div class="sa-qtile"><span class="sa-qicon">02</span><h3>Where are the gaps?</h3><p>Pinpoint material weaknesses, recurring findings and areas that need attention.</p></div><div class="sa-qtile"><span class="sa-qicon">03</span><h3>What proves it?</h3><p>Trace every reported position back to the supporting evidence and assessment.</p></div><div class="sa-qtile"><span class="sa-qicon">04</span><h3>What happens next?</h3><p>Prioritise interventions, assign corrective actions and track progress to closure.</p></div></div></div></section>
